# AC semantic probe: persisted cache roundtrip (PLAN-796 T-01)

status: not-executed — versioned contract file until D-788 + T-06 (see
infer-bindings.case.ad for the pending marker rationale). The
Rust-directed counterpart that DOES run today:
`sema_cache_first_case_cross_process_roundtrip` and
`sema_cache_first_case_callee_signature_change_invalidates` in
`experimental/ac-semantics/probe/tests/sema_cache_first_case.rs`.

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/1"
  id: "ac.sema.cache-roundtrip"
  tags: ["ac-semantics", "not-executed-until-D-788"]
  source: { file: "cases/ac-semantics/src/cache-roundtrip.at", syntax: "ac-core", path: "cache-roundtrip.at" }
  sema: { package: "probe", module: "cache-roundtrip" }
  checks: [
    { id: "cold-publish", adapter: "sema", action: "query",
      query: { kind: "infer-body", fn: "main" },
      expect: { completion: "success", cache: "miss-then-published" } },
    { id: "restart-hit", adapter: "sema", action: "query", after: "process-restart",
      query: { kind: "infer-body", fn: "main" },
      expect: { completion: "success", cache: "hit", compute_called: false } },
    { id: "callee-sig-change-stale", adapter: "sema", action: "query",
      mutate: { replace: "helper(a int, b int)", with: "helper(a bool, b int)" },
      query: { kind: "infer-body", fn: "main" },
      expect: { completion: "success", cache: "stale",
        reason_contains: "fn-sig:helper" } }
  ]
}
```
